","parts":[{"text":"மீன்வலை","lemma":"மீன்வலை","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"மாப்பட்","parts":[{"text":"மாப்பட்","lemma":"மாப்பட்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"டாஅங்","parts":[{"text":"டாஅங்","lemma":"டாஅங்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true}],"as_printed":true},{"words":[{"surface":"கிதுமற்","parts":[{"text":"கிதுமற்","lemma":"கிதுமற்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"றெவனோ","parts":[{"text":"றெவனோ","lemma":"றெவனோ","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"நொதுமலர்","parts":[{"text":"நொதுமலர்","lemma":"நொதுமலர்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"தலையே","parts":[{"text":"தலையே","lemma":"தலையே","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true}],"as_printed":true}],"literal":"See now, may you live, friend! / In the deep pool of the close bank of the swift flood of fresh fertility, cast / fish net, like a beast caught in it, / what indeed is this in the place of strangers?","translation":"Look here, my friend, may you live long! Like a wild beast caught in a fishing net cast in the deep pool near the bank of the swift, fertile river, what is this gossip about me in the neighborhood of strangers?","modern":"தோழியே, நீ வாழ்க! இப்போது பார்! புதிய வருவாயைத் தரும் வேகமான வெள்ளம் வந்து அடையும் கரையை உடைய பெரிய குளத்தில் வீசப்பட்ட மீன் வலையில் ஒரு விலங்கு மாட்டிக்கொண்டது போல, அயலார் வாழும் இப்பகுதியில் எழுந்துள்ள இந்த அலர் என்னவோ?","explanation":"The heroine is speaking to her close friend about the rumors that have arisen in her neighborhood regarding her secret love affair. She compares herself to a wild beast that has accidentally become trapped in a net meant only for catching fish. The fish net represents the gossip that has suddenly enveloped her, making her private love affair public. This image belongs to the Marutham (agricultural) landscape, where rivers, deep pools, and fishing nets are common. The key words are 'மீன்வலை' (fish net), 'மா' (beast), and 'நொதுமலர்' (strangers/neighbors).","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"}}